WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:01.839
You can also define extensive lists

00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:03.580
of synonyms for entity types.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.640
Why synonyms? If corporate formally

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.020
calls it a retail location, but

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.640
the regional managers always ask the

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.880
chat about the shops, you define

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.379
shop as a synonym so the

00:00:14.379 --> 00:00:15.860
AI knows they mean the exact

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.610
same entity.
